  "plain": "Seven days after a witness saw something crash near the town of Varginha, Brazil, in 1996, a man named Kuber Lada was leaving a gym with several friends when they saw two military trucks driving into town. The documentary filmmaker James Fox tells this on Michels' show, passing on what Lada told him. It is one of many accounts from Varginha that, if true, would mean the army moved in to collect a living being that was not human."
